{"systemMessage":"RV · Blocked\nBlocked git reset --hard (core.git/reset-hard). Run it in Terminal, or rv allow-once.","hookSpecificOutput":{"hookEventName":"PreToolUse","permissionDecision":"deny","permissionDecisionReason":"RV · Blocked\nBlocked git reset --hard (core.git/reset-hard). Run it in Terminal, or rv allow-once.\nReason: git reset --hard destroys uncommitted changes. Use 'git stash' first.\nExplanation: Discards every uncommitted change.\nRule: core.git:reset-hard\nCommand: git reset --hard\nIf you need this, run it in Terminal, or use rv allow-once in a TTY.","ruleId":"core.git:reset-hard","packId":"core.git","severity":"critical","remediation":{"explanation":"Discards every uncommitted change.","safeAlternative":"git reset --hard destroys uncommitted changes. Use 'git stash' first.","allowOnceCommand":"rv allow-once"}}}
